# Lesson Unit Standards

Applies to all `README.md` files inside course unit directories.

## Structure of a Lesson

```markdown
← [Назад](../prev-unit/) | [Оглавление](../../README.md) | [Далее →](../next-unit/)

# Заголовок урока

> **Модуль N · Урок M** | Время: ~X мин

## Содержание
(main content with examples, terminal output, explanations)

## Сравнение с альтернативами
(optional inline comparison: "pyenv vs conda" etc.)

## Частые ошибки
(common mistakes and how to avoid them, at the end of every lesson)

---
← [Назад](../prev-unit/) | [Оглавление](../../README.md) | [Далее →](../next-unit/)
```

## Content Rules

- Terminal output in fenced `bash` blocks, NOT screenshots.
- Screenshots/GIFs only for GUI actions (Jupyter in browser).
- New terminal commands: 1–2 sentence explanation inline.
- New terms: define on first use, link to glossary.
- Comparisons with alternatives: brief inline inserts, not separate sections unless warranted.
- "Частые ошибки" section is mandatory at the end of every lesson.
